{"id":"afc1fb30a05f3662","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-fibred-functor.md","title":"纤维函子","display":"df-fibred-functor — 纤维函子","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-df-fibred-functor","display":"df-fibred-functor — 纤维函子","depends_on":["[[16-df-fibration]]","[[16-df-functor]]","[[16-df-cartesian-morphism]]","[[16-df-natural-transformation-definition]]"],"source":"Definitions 1.7.1, 1.7.3(i), 1.7.7, pp. 73–76 (PDF 93–96)","revision_date":"2026-10-20","aliases":["16-df-fibred-functor"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-fibred-functor"},{"key":"display","html":"df-fibred-functor — 纤维函子"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c9801f31ec8ac53f\" href=\"?note=c9801f31ec8ac53f\" title=\"16-df-fibration\">16-df-fibration</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fc49efccd7348d66\" href=\"?note=fc49efccd7348d66\" title=\"16-df-functor\">16-df-functor</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"427be4d627513590\" href=\"?note=427be4d627513590\" title=\"16-df-cartesian-morphism\">16-df-cartesian-morphism</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"25140205ca0312de\" href=\"?note=25140205ca0312de\" title=\"16-df-natural-transformation-definition\">16-df-natural-transformation-definition</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Definitions 1.7.1, 1.7.3(i), 1.7.7, pp. 73–76 (PDF 93–96)"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-20"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-fibred-functor</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\">\\(p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q:\\mathcal D\\to\\mathcal B\">\\(q:\\mathcal D\\to\\mathcal B\\)</span> 为纤维化，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal D\">\\(H:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal D\\)</span> 为函子，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c9801f31ec8ac53f\" href=\"?note=c9801f31ec8ac53f\" title=\"16-df-fibration\">16-df-fibration</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"fc49efccd7348d66\" href=\"?note=fc49efccd7348d66\" title=\"16-df-functor\">16-df-functor</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cartesian}_p\">\\(\\mathrm{Cartesian}_p\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cartesian}_q\">\\(\\mathrm{Cartesian}_q\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"427be4d627513590\" href=\"?note=427be4d627513590\" title=\"16-df-cartesian-morphism\">16-df-cartesian-morphism</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>第二式的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H,K:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal D\">\\(H,K:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal D\\)</span> 是同一对纤维化之间的纤维函子；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta=(\\eta_X)_{X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E}\">\\(\\eta=(\\eta_X)_{X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E}\\)</span> 是候选集合分量族，每个分量已有值。只有自然变换检查成立时才对这些分量应用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\">\\(q\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FibredFunctor}\">\\(\\mathrm{FibredFunctor}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{VerticalNat}\">\\(\\mathrm{VerticalNat}\\)</span> 为本原子定义的记号，其结构参数与完整条件在下文给出。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NatTrans}\">\\(\\mathrm{NatTrans}\\)</span> 的定义及结构参数见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"25140205ca0312de\" href=\"?note=25140205ca0312de\" title=\"16-df-natural-transformation-definition\">16-df-natural-transformation-definition</a>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}fibred\\text{-}functor}\\vdash\\quad \\mathrm{FibredFunctor}(H;p,q)\\Longleftrightarrow\nqH=p\\land(\\forall f\\in\\operatorname{Mor}\\mathcal E)\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Cartesian}_p(f)\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{Cartesian}_q(Hf)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}fibred\\text{-}functor}\\vdash\\quad \\mathrm{FibredFunctor}(H;p,q)\\Longleftrightarrow\nqH=p\\land(\\forall f\\in\\operatorname{Mor}\\mathcal E)\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Cartesian}_p(f)\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{Cartesian}_q(Hf)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{VerticalNat}(\\eta:H\\Rightarrow K)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\begin{cases}\n(\\forall X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E)\\ q(\\eta_X)=\\operatorname{id}_{pX}\n&amp;\\mathrm{NatTrans}_{\\mathcal E,\\mathcal D}(\\eta:H\\Rightarrow K),\\\\\n\\bot&amp;\\neg\\mathrm{NatTrans}_{\\mathcal E,\\mathcal D}(\\eta:H\\Rightarrow K).\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{VerticalNat}(\\eta:H\\Rightarrow K)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\begin{cases}\n(\\forall X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E)\\ q(\\eta_X)=\\operatorname{id}_{pX}\n&amp;\\mathrm{NatTrans}_{\\mathcal E,\\mathcal D}(\\eta:H\\Rightarrow K),\\\\\n\\bot&amp;\\neg\\mathrm{NatTrans}_{\\mathcal E,\\mathcal D}(\\eta:H\\Rightarrow K).\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>第二式的 <code>NatTrans</code> 指具有逐分量自然性方块的自然变换；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H,K\">\\(H,K\\)</span> 均为同一对纤维化之间的纤维函子。</li>\n<li>对有 cleavage 的纤维化，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_Iu^*\\cong u^*H_J\">\\(H_Iu^*\\cong u^*H_J\\)</span> 是由保持笛卡尔提升得到的规范自然同构。</li>\n<li>来源：Jacobs, <em>Categorical Logic and Type Theory</em>，Definitions 1.7.1, 1.7.3(i), 1.7.7, pp. 73–76 (PDF 93–96)。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"c9801f31ec8ac53f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-fibration]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-functor","status":"resolved","id":"fc49efccd7348d66","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-functor]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-cartesian-morphism","status":"resolved","id":"427be4d627513590","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-cartesian-morphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-natural-transformation-definition","status":"resolved","id":"25140205ca0312de","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-natural-transformation-definition]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"c9801f31ec8ac53f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$、$q:\\mathcal D\\to\\mathcal B$ 为纤维化，$H:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal D$ 为函子，见 [[16-df-fibration]]、[[16-df-functor]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-functor","status":"resolved","id":"fc49efccd7348d66","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$、$q:\\mathcal D\\to\\mathcal B$ 为纤维化，$H:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal D$ 为函子，见 [[16-df-fibration]]、[[16-df-functor]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-cartesian-morphism","status":"resolved","id":"427be4d627513590","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cartesian}_p$、$\\mathrm{Cartesian}_q$ 采用 [[16-df-cartesian-morphism]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-natural-transformation-definition","status":"resolved","id":"25140205ca0312de","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{NatTrans}$ 的定义及结构参数见 [[16-df-natural-transformation-definition]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"q:\\mathcal D\\to\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"H:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal D","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cartesian}_p","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cartesian}_q","display":false},{"tex":"H,K:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal D","display":false},{"tex":"\\eta=(\\eta_X)_{X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E}","display":false},{"tex":"q","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FibredFunctor}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{VerticalNat}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NatTrans}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}fibred\\text{-}functor}\\vdash\\quad \\mathrm{FibredFunctor}(H;p,q)\\Longleftrightarrow\nqH=p\\land(\\forall f\\in\\operatorname{Mor}\\mathcal E)\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Cartesian}_p(f)\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{Cartesian}_q(Hf)\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{VerticalNat}(\\eta:H\\Rightarrow K)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\begin{cases}\n(\\forall X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E)\\ q(\\eta_X)=\\operatorname{id}_{pX}\n&\\mathrm{NatTrans}_{\\mathcal E,\\mathcal D}(\\eta:H\\Rightarrow K),\\\\\n\\bot&\\neg\\mathrm{NatTrans}_{\\mathcal E,\\mathcal D}(\\eta:H\\Rightarrow K).\n\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"H,K","display":false},{"tex":"H_Iu^*\\cong u^*H_J","display":false}],"bytes":2159,"backlinks":[{"id":"7ef7c23f9a9f13d7","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"17bdb224f449da45","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$L:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal D$、$X:\\mathcal D\\to\\mathcal E$；$\\eta:\\operatorname{Id}_{\\mathcal E}\\Rightarrow XL$、$\\epsilon:LX\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{Id}_{\\mathcal D}$ 是垂直自然变换，采用 [[16-df-fibred-functor]]。"},{"id":"327b5aca93ba8aef","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{dom}_I:\\mathcal B/I\\to\\mathcal B$ 采用 [[16-df-slice-category]]；$\\mathrm{FibredFunctor}$、$\\mathrm{VerticalNat}$ 采用 [[16-df-fibred-functor]]。所有函子和变换的数据在足够大的宇宙中编码。"},{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-236","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[16-df-fibred-functor|df-fibred-functor — 纤维函子]]"},{"id":"c777f05b6d404ce4","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FibredFunctor}$ 见 [[16-df-fibred-functor]]。"},{"id":"d384d77e035108ca","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FibredFunctor}$、$\\mathrm{VerticalNat}$ 采用 [[16-df-fibred-functor]]；$\\operatorname{Fun}$、$\\mathrm{NatIso}$ 采用 [[16-df-natural-transformation-definition]]。自然变换族的恒等与复合逐分量按下文构造。"}],"outgoing":["c9801f31ec8ac53f","fc49efccd7348d66","427be4d627513590","25140205ca0312de"]}